{"article_ids": ["d7562d933fd4536a"], "canonical_title": "LeanStream: A Speculate-and-Refine Streaming Framework for Efficient on-Device LLM Inference", "category": "research", "confidence": 0.7, "description": "Researchers presented LeanStream, a new framework that streams model weights to mobile or embedded devices while speculatively executing early layers and later refining results as more context becomes available. This approach tackles the trade‑off in prior systems between needing up‑to‑date context for sparse execution decisions and overlapping computation with I/O for efficiency.", "entities": ["term:dram", "term:ssd"], "first_seen": "2026-09-04T04:00:00Z", "id": "evt_d7562d933fd4536a", "importance_score": 6.84, "last_updated": "2026-09-04T04:00:00Z", "source_ids": ["arxiv-cs-lg"]}
{"article_ids": ["325e9dcd840a97e9", "065ff303a9da30f4", "039a4975e102cb53"], "canonical_title": "Playco cut manual fixes 50% prototyping games with GPT-6 Astra", "category": "other", "confidence": 0.85, "description": "OpenAI released GPT-6 Astra, calling it a generational leap and the first model to meet its critical cybersecurity capability threshold. Playco used the model to create three themed game prototypes from a single grey‑box foundation and reported 50 % fewer manual fixes compared with its previous model.", "entities": ["model:gpt", "model:gpt-6", "org:openai", "term:agi", "term:arc", "term:gpt", "term:url"], "first_seen": "2026-09-03T12:00:00Z", "id": "evt_325e9dcd840a97e9", "importance_score": 6.32, "last_updated": "2026-09-03T18:41:05Z", "source_ids": ["openai", "the-verge-ai", "hacker-news"]}
{"article_ids": ["1ad1eb866511b540"], "canonical_title": "Speculative Macro Commit for Faster Tool-Using Agents", "category": "research", "confidence": 0.73, "description": "Researchers presented Speculative Macro Commit (SMC), a runtime mechanism that pairs a large authoritative actor model with a faster speculative drafter model. The drafter continuously predicts future actions while the authoritative model finalizes the official trajectory, aiming to reduce wall‑clock time spent on serial tool‑call and observation steps.", "entities": ["term:smc"], "first_seen": "2026-09-04T04:00:00Z", "id": "evt_1ad1eb866511b540", "importance_score": 6.04, "last_updated": "2026-09-04T04:00:00Z", "source_ids": ["arxiv-cs-ai"]}
